WEBVTT

00:00:59.204 --> 00:01:03.996
How did the Democrats
and the Republicans keep doing so well

00:01:04.038 --> 00:01:08.746
when their customers,
that's us, are so unhappy?

00:01:09.496 --> 00:01:12.704
Why is the politics industry win-lose?

00:01:12.746 --> 00:01:14.079
They win.

00:01:14.121 --> 00:01:15.621
We lose.

00:01:15.663 --> 00:01:16.996
The answer?

00:01:17.038 --> 00:01:22.954
It turns out that one thing
almost all Americans agree on,

00:01:22.996 --> 00:01:25.413
"Washington is broken,"

00:01:25.454 --> 00:01:29.538
is also one thing we're all wrong about.